        "en": "Z czym?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Z* (with) takes the instrumental (*narzędnik*: *z kim? z czym?*). A masculine or neuter noun ends in *-em*, a feminine one in *-ą*: *chleb z masłem*, *herbata z cytryną*. *Bez* (without) takes the genitive: *kawa bez cukru*, *herbata bez mleka*."
      },
